{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-18393" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\frac{3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-x-1}{{x}^{2}+x+1}=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-18393" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x-5 \\\\  & {x}^{2}+x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-x-1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}+3x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-5{x}^{2}-4x-1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,5{x}^{2}-5x-5}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x+4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $3x-5,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $x+4.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-x-1}{{x}^{2}+x+1}=3x-5+\\frac{x+4}{{x}^{2}+x+1}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-18393" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-18393" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-18393" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "3x-5+\\frac{4}{{x}^{2}+x+1}"] ["math" "3x-5+\\frac{x+4}{{x}^{2}+x+1}"] ["math" "3x-5+\\frac{{x}^{2}+x+1}{x+4}"] ["math" "3x-5-\\frac{x+4}{{x}^{2}+x+1}"] ["math" "x+4+\\frac{3x-5}{{x}^{2}+x+1}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-18393" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "3x-5+\\frac{x+4}{{x}^{2}+x+1}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-321926" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the quotient of $15{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}-15x-11$ divided by $3{x}^{2}-x-4?$\n\nThe quotient is\n{{field-1}}." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-321926" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5x+2 \\\\  & 3{x}^{2}-x-4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,15{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}-15x-11\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{15{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}-20x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6{x}^{2}+5x-11 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{2}-2x-8}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7x-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $5x+2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $7x-3.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-321926" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-321926" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-321926" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "5x+2"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-37991" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the remainder when $3{x}^{3}-12{x}^{2}-87x-12$ is divided by ${x}^{2}-5x-24?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-37991" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x+3 \\\\  & {x}^{2}-5x-24\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,3{x}^{3}-12{x}^{2}-87x-12\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}-15{x}^{2}-72x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{2}-15x-12 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{2}-15x-72}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,60\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $3x+3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $60.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-37991" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-37991" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-37991" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-60"] ["math" "-84"] ["math" "60"] ["math" "72"] ["math" "84"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-37991" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "60"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-322774" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Express $\\frac{12{x}^{3}-20x+96}{2{x}^{2}-3x+5}$ in the form $q(x)+\\frac{r(x)}{2{x}^{2}-3x+5},$ where $q(x)$ is the quotient and $r(x)$ is the reminder of the division.$$\n\n| $12{x}^{3}-20x+96$ | __ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $2{x}^{2}-3x+5$ | __ |  |  | $2{x}^{2}-3x+5$ |" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-322774" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6x+9 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-3x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,12{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}-20x+96\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{12{x}^{3}-18{x}^{2}+30x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,18{x}^{2}-50x+96 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,18{x}^{2}-27x+45}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-23x+51\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $6x+9,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-23x+51.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{12{x}^{3}-20x+96}{2{x}^{2}-3x+5}=6x+9+\\frac{(-23x+51)}{2{x}^{2}-3x+5}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-322774" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-322774" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-322774" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "6x+9"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-322774" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-322774" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-23x+51"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-321924" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the quotient of $-14{x}^{3}+43{x}^{2}-50x+17$ divided by $2{x}^{2}-5x+3?$\n\nThe quotient is\n{{field-1}}." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-321924" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-7x+4 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-5x+3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-14{x}^{3}+43{x}^{2}-50x+17\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-14{x}^{3}+35{x}^{2}-21x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,8{x}^{2}-29x+17 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{8{x}^{2}-20x+12}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-9x+5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $-7x+4,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-9x+5.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-321924" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-321924" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-321924" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-7x+4"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325110" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the remainder of $-6{x}^{4}+7{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+6x+2$ divided by $3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+5x-4?$\n\nThe remainder is\n{{field-1}}." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325110" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x+1 \\\\  & 3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+5x-4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-6{x}^{4}+7{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+6x+2\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,6{x}^{4}+4{x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}+8x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}-\\,2x+2 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+5x-4}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{2}-7x+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $-2x+1,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $4{x}^{2}-7x+6.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325110" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-325110" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325110" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "4x^2-7x+6"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-322923" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the quotient of $-4{x}^{4}+21{x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}+7$ divided by $-{x}^{2}+4x+3?$\n\nThe quotient is\n{{field-1}}." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-322923" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{2}-5x+2 \\\\  & -{x}^{2}+4x+3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-4{x}^{4}+21{x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}+0x+7\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,4{x}^{4}+16{x}^{3}+12{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5{x}^{3}-22{x}^{2}+0x+7 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{5{x}^{3}-20{x}^{2}-15x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}+15x+7 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-2{x}^{2}+8x+6}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7x+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $4{x}^{2}-5x+2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $7x+1.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-322923" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-322923" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-322923" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "4x^2-5x+2"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325105" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the quotient of $-6{x}^{4}+11{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+20x-18$ divided by $2{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+3x-5?$\n\nThe quotient is\n{{field-1}}." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325105" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-3x+4 \\\\  & 2{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+3x-5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-6{x}^{4}+11{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+20x-18\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,6{x}^{4}+3{x}^{3}-9{x}^{2}+15x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,8{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}+5x-18 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{8{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+12x-20}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5{x}^{2}-7x+2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $-3x+4,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $5{x}^{2}-7x+2.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325105" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-325105" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325105" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-3x+4"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-105622" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\frac{{x}^{4}+3{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-5x+4}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-105622" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}+x-2 \\\\  & {x}^{2}+2x-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{4}+3{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-5x+4\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{4}+2{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}-5x+4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}-x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}-4x+4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,2{x}^{2}-4x+2}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is ${x}^{2}+x-2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $2.$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{4}+3{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-5x+4}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}={x}^{2}+x-2+\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-105622" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-105622" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-105622" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{x}^{2}+2x-1+\\frac{4}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}"] ["math" "{x}^{2}+x+1+\\frac{5}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}"] ["math" "{x}^{2}+x-1+\\frac{6}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}"] ["math" "{x}^{2}+x-2+\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}"] ["math" "{x}^{2}-2+\\frac{x+2}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-105622" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{x}^{2}+x-2+\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}+2x-1}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-104257" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\frac{8{x}^{4}-4{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}+4x-3}{2{x}^{2}-x+2}=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-104257" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{2}-1 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,8{x}^{4}-4{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}+4x-3\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{8{x}^{4}-4{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}+4x-3 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,2{x}^{2}+x-2}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is $4{x}^{2}-1,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $3x-1.$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{8{x}^{4}-4{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}+4x-3}{2{x}^{2}-x+2}=4{x}^{2}-1+\\frac{3x-1}{2{x}^{2}-x+2}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-104257" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-104257" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-104257" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "3x-1+\\frac{4{x}^{2}+1}{2{x}^{2}-x+2}"] ["math" "4{x}^{2}+1+\\frac{3x-1}{2{x}^{2}-x+2}"] ["math" "4{x}^{2}+1-\\frac{3x-1}{2{x}^{2}-x+2}"] ["math" "4{x}^{2}-1+\\frac{2{x}^{2}-x+2}{3x-1}"] ["math" "4{x}^{2}-1+\\frac{3x-1}{2{x}^{2}-x+2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-104257" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "4{x}^{2}-1+\\frac{3x-1}{2{x}^{2}-x+2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-38003" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the remainder when  $27{x}^{3}+8$ is divided by $9{x}^{2}-6x+4?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-38003" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{2}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n27{x}^{3}+8=27{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+8\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x+2 \\\\  & 9{x}^{2}-6x+4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,27{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{27{x}^{3}-18{x}^{2}+12x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,18{x}^{2}-12x+8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{18{x}^{2}-12x+8}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $3x+2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $0.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-38003" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-38003" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-38003" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-8"] ["math" "0"] ["math" "1"] ["math" "x"] ["math" "x-2"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-38003" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "0"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-114512" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the quotient of $2{x}^{4}-{x}^{2}-1$ divided by $2{x}^{2}+1?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-114512" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{3}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n2{x}^{4}-{x}^{2}-1=2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+0x-1\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-1 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+0x-1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,2{x}^{2}+0x-1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+0x-1}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is ${x}^{2}-1,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $0.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-114512" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-114512" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-114512" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{x}^{2}+1"] ["math" "{x}^{2}-1"] ["math" "{x}^{2}-2x+1"] ["math" "{x}^{2}-3x+2"] ["math" "{x}^{2}-x-2"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-114512" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{x}^{2}-1"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-3824" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the remainder when ${x}^{4}+{x}^{2}+2$ is divided by ${x}^{2}+x+1?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-3824" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{3}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n{x}^{4}+{x}^{2}+2={x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}+0x+2\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-x+1 \\\\  & {x}^{2}+x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}+0x+2\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{4}+{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x+2 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}-x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}+x+2 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{2}+x+1}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is ${x}^{2}-x+1,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $1.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-3824" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-3824" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-3824" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-x+3"] ["math" "1"] ["math" "2x+1"] ["math" "x-1"] ["math" "{x}^{2}-x"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-3824" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "1"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-114522" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "What is the remainder when ${x}^{4}+2{x}^{3}-1$ is divided by ${x}^{2}+1?$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-114522" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{2}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with a coefficient of zero, as follows:\n\n$$\n{x}^{4}+2{x}^{3}-1={x}^{4}+2{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x-1\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}+2x-1 \\\\  & {x}^{2}+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{4}+2{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x-1\\,\\,\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+0x-1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,-{x}^{2}-2x-1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-{x}^{2}+0x-1}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,-2x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is ${x}^{2}+2x-1,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-2x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-114522" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-114522" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-114522" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2x"] ["math" "-3x+2"] ["math" "-4x-1"] ["math" "2x+1"] ["math" "5x"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-114522" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-2x"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325149" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Express $\\frac{4{x}^{4}+3{x}^{2}+3}{\\,{x}^{2}-x+2\\,}$ in the form $q(x)+\\frac{r(x)}{\\,{x}^{2}-x+2\\,},$ where $q(x)$ is the quotient and $r(x)$ is the reminder of the division.$$\n\n| $4{x}^{4}+3{x}^{2}+3$ | __ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${x}^{2}-x+2$ | __ |  |  | ${x}^{2}-x+2$ |" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325149" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{3}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n4{x}^{4}+3{x}^{2}+3\\,=\\,4{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}+0x+3\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{2}+4x-1 \\\\  & {x}^{2}-x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}+0x+3\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{4}-4{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}+0x+3 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+8x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,{x}^{2}-8x+3 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,{x}^{2}+x-2}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,9x+5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $4{x}^{2}+4x-1,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-9x+5.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{4{x}^{4}+3{x}^{2}+3}{\\,{x}^{2}-x+2\\,}=\\,4{x}^{2}+4x-1\\,+\\frac{\\,(-9x+5)\\,}{\\,{x}^{2}-x+2\\,}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325149" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "930c305db0fb9a16ee721e8a81423988274f0b6fa20a40289eef54f227021122"} {"question" "q-325149" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325149" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "4x^2+4x-1"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325149" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "q-325149" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-9x+5"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/state.json" "file_sha256" "8a9cab86332a4d2755dc253da53d498706bfef08ee46e8aed8fabbfc3105d74e"} {"question" "e-5143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Determine the quotient and remainder of $6x^3-x^2+3x+1$ divided by $3x^2+x+2.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/example-5143.json" "file_sha256" "b992f1f054f206873d1a4f5e1b5c98579ce41f766ddd55f3b916fbe159981f3a"} {"question" "e-5143" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-1 \\\\  & 3{x}^{2}+x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,6{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+3x+1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+4x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-3{x}^{2}-x+1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,3{x}^{2}-x-2}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is ${\\color{blue}2x-1},$ and\n\n- the remainder is ${\\color{red}3}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/example-5143.json" "file_sha256" "b992f1f054f206873d1a4f5e1b5c98579ce41f766ddd55f3b916fbe159981f3a"} {"question" "e-8932" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the quotient and remainder of the following division problem:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {5x^4- 2x^3 - 18x^2 + 11x - 13} {5x^2-2x+2}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/example-8932.json" "file_sha256" "22faa5b4a445a38771b9052681e5dfd9eb3de3d2c484275aa9db40b5aa0a2b57"} {"question" "e-8932" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-4 \\\\  & 5{x}^{2}-2x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,5{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-18{x}^{2}+11x-13\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{5{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-20{x}^{2}+11x-13 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,20{x}^{2}+8x-8}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is $x^2-4,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $3x-5.$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\dfrac{5x^4-2x^3-18x^2+11x-13}{5x^2-2x+2}=x^2-4 + \\dfrac{3x-5}{5x^2-2x+2}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/example-8932.json" "file_sha256" "22faa5b4a445a38771b9052681e5dfd9eb3de3d2c484275aa9db40b5aa0a2b57"} {"question" "e-5144" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the quotient and remainder of the following division problem:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x + 8}{x^2 - 1}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/example-5144.json" "file_sha256" "5ffe784e3e97829c4ac4a3da76a26fb7bfff337f9de7b4aa5b48bbf6c19d3c8b"} {"question" "e-5144" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x^3$ term. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing term with a coefficient of zero, as follows:\n\n$$\n2x^4-7x^2-x+8 = 2x^4+{\\color{red}0}x^3-7x^2-x+8\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2{x}^{2}-5 \\\\  & {x}^{2}-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}-7{x}^{2}-x+8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-5{x}^{2}-x+8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,5{x}^{2}+0x+5}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-x+3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is ${2x^2 - 5},$ and\n\n- the remainder is ${-x+3}.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x +8}{x^2 - 1} \n= \n2x^2-5 + \\dfrac{-x+3}{x^2-1}.\n$$\n\nWe can rewrite this result as follows:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x +8}{x^2 - 1} \n= \n2x^2-5 - \\dfrac{x-3}{x^2-1}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14055203/example-5144.json" "file_sha256" "5ffe784e3e97829c4ac4a3da76a26fb7bfff337f9de7b4aa5b48bbf6c19d3c8b"}] "usage" {"e-5143" [] "q-104257" [] "e-5144" [] "e-8932" []} "basis" 1811 "retractions" [[17592186068936 :question/problem "What is $\\frac{8x^{4} - 4x^{3} + 6x^{2} + 4x - 3}{2x^{2} - x + 2}$?"] [17592186068523 :question/problem "Determine the quotient and remainder of $6x^3-x^2+3x+1$ divided by $3x^2+x+2$."] [17592186068523 :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n3x^{2} + x + 22x - 1; 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3} - 0x^{2} + 3x + 1; 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3} + 2x^{2} + 4x_(―); 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3} - 3x^{2} - 0x + 1; 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3}- 3x^{2} - 0x - 2_(―); 3x^{2} + x + 26x^{3} - 3x^{2} - x +3\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is ${\\color{blue}2x-1}$, and\n- the remainder is ${\\color{red}3}$."] [17592186068584 :question/problem "Find the quotient and remainder of the following division problem:\n$\\dfrac {5x^4- 2x^3 - 18x^2 + 11x - 13} {5x^2-2x+2}$"] [17592186068584 :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n5x^{2} - 2x + 2x^{2} - 4; 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3} - 18x^{2} + 11x - 13; 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3} + 02x^{2}_(―); 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3} - 20x^{2} + 11x - 13; 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3}- 20x^{2} + 08x - 08_(―); 5x^{2} - 2x + 25x^{4} - 2x^{3} - 20x^{2} +03x - 05\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is $x^2-4$, and\n- the remainder is $3x-5$.\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{5x^4-2x^3-18x^2+11x-13}{5x^2-2x+2}=x^2-4 + \\dfrac{3x-5}{5x^2-2x+2}\n$$"] [17592186068524 :question/problem "Find the quotient and remainder of the following division problem:\n\n$\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x + 8}{x^2 - 1}$"] [17592186068524 :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x^3$ term. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing term with a coefficient of zero, as follows:\n\n$$\n2x^4-7x^2-x+8 = 2x^4+{\\color{red}0}x^3-7x^2-x+8\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\nx^{2} - 12x^{2} - 5; x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3} - 7x^{2} - 0x + 8; x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3} - 2x^{2}_(―); x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3} - 5x^{2} - 0x + 8; x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3}- 5x^{2} + 0x + 5_(―); x^{2} - 12x^{4} + 0x^{3} - 5x^{2}- 0x + 3\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is ${2x^2 - 5}$, and\n- the remainder is ${-x+3}$.\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x +8}{x^2 - 1} = 2x^2-5 + \\dfrac{-x+3}{x^2-1}\n$$\n\nWe can rewrite this result as follows:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x +8}{x^2 - 1} = 2x^2-5 - \\dfrac{x-3}{x^2-1}\n$$"]] "immutable_answers" [17592186065411 17592186065412 17592186065413 17592186065414 17592186065415] "immutable_fields" [[17592186065410 :answer-field/correct] [17592186065410 :answer-field/id] [17592186065410 :answer-field/key] [17592186065410 :answer-field/type]] "no_history" []}
